hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zuhr aur Asr ikatthi, aur Maghrib aur Isha ikatthi padhin, baghair khauf aur safar ke. Malik bin Anas [Rahimahullah] kehte hain: Mera khayal hai yeh barish mein tha."
"23","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Madinah mein aath [rak'aten] ikatthi aur saat [rak'aten] ikatthi padhin. Ravi kehte hain: Main ne Abu Sha'sa se kaha: Mera khayal hai Aap ne Zuhr mein takheer farmai aur Asr jaldi padhi, aur Maghrib mein takheer farmai aur Isha jaldi padhi. Unhon ne kaha: Aur mera bhi yahi khayal hai."
"24","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath aath [rak'aten] ikatthi aur saat [rak'aten] ikatthi padhin. Main ne kaha: Aap ne aisa kyun kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne chaha ke Apni ummat ko tangi mein na dalen."
"25","[AI-translation] Abu Yunus (Rahimahullah), jo Aishah Ummul Momineen [Raziyallahu anha] ke aazad karda ghulam the, se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Aishah Ummul Momineen ne hukm diya ke un ke liye ek mushaf likhun. Unhon ne kaha: Jab tum is aayat tak pahuncho to mujhe khabar do: ﴿حَافِظُوا عَلَى الصَّلَوَاتِ وَالصَّلَاةِ الْوُسْطَى﴾ [Al-Baqarah: 238]. Ravi kehte hain: Phir jab main us tak pahuncha to main ne unhen khabar di, to unhon ne mujhe likhwaya: [Namazon aur darmiyani namaz aur Asr ki namaz ki hifazat karo, aur Allah ke liye farmanbardar ho kar khade raho]: '[Main ne ise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna].' Aishah ne kaha: Main ne ise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna."
"26","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hafsah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kabhi Apni [nafl] namaz mein baith kar namaz padhte nahin dekha, yahan tak ke Aap ki wafat se ek saal pehle; to Aap Apni [nafl] namaz mein baith kar namaz padhte, aur surat padhte aur use thah thah kar padhte, yahan tak ke woh us se lambi ho jati jo us se lambi hai [mamool se]."
"27","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne use khabar di ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kabhi raat ki namaz baith kar padhte nahin dekha yahan tak ke Aap budhe ho gaye; to Aap baith kar qiraat farmate, yahan tak ke jab ruku ka irada farmate to khade ho jate, phir tees ya chalis aayaton ke qareeb padhte, phir ruku farmate."
"28","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah Ummul Momineen (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baith kar namaz padhte aur baith kar qiraat farmate; phir jab Aap ki qiraat mein se tees ya chalis aayaton ke qadar baqi rehta to khade ho jate aur khade ho kar qiraat farmate, phir ruku farmate, phir sajda farmate, phir dusri rak'at mein bhi aisa hi farmate."
"29","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baith kar qiraat farmate, phir jab ruku ka irada farmate to utni der khade rehte jitni der mein aadmi chalis aayaten padhe."
"30","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi apni namaz mein oonghe to so jae yahan tak ke us se neend ka asar jata rahe; kyunke jab tum mein se koi namaz padhta hai jabke woh oongh raha hai, to ho sakta hai woh istighfar karne jae aur apne aap ko bura kahe!'"
"31","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi oonghe jabke woh namaz padh raha hai to [namaz se] phir jae; kyunke woh nahin janta, ho sakta hai woh istighfar karne lage aur apne aap ko bura kahe.'"
"32","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do sutoonon ke darmiyan bandhi hui ek rassi dekhi, to farmaya: 'Yeh rassi kaisi hai?' Logon ne kaha: Falan [aurat] ki hai, woh namaz padhti hai; jab us par [neend] ghalib aa jati hai to us se latak jati hai. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Aisa na karo, woh namaz padhe jab tak hosh mein rahe; phir jab us par [neend] ghalib aa jae to so jae.'"
"33","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek namaz se phire jis mein Aap ne buland aawaz se qiraat farmai thi, phir farmaya: 'Kya tum mein se kisi ne abhi mere sath [qiraat] padhi?' Ek aadmi ne kaha: Ji, Ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: 'Main kehta hun: Mujhe kya hai ke mujh se Quran [ki qiraat] mein muqabla kiya jata hai?' Ravi kehte hain: To log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath un namazon mein jin mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) buland aawaz se qiraat farmate, qiraat se ruk gaye, jab unhon ne yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna."
"34","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah Sulami (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein dakhil ho to baithne se pehle do rak'aten padhe.'"
"35","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Log Quba mein Subah ki namaz mein the ke achanak un ke paas ek aane wala aaya aur kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par aaj raat Quran nazil hua hai, 'Aur Aap ko hukm diya gaya hai ke Ka'ba ki taraf munh karen, to tum us ki taraf munh karo.' Jabke un ke chehre Shaam ki taraf the, to woh Ka'ba ki taraf ghoom gaye."
"36","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyib (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, woh kaha karte the: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Madinah tashreef lane ke ba'd solah mahine Baitul Maqdis ki taraf munh karke namaz padhi, phir Badr se do mahine pehle qibla pher diya gaya."
